      "value": "<p><em>Overlay (midi-qol):</em> the area placed is a barrier: the wall or ring stops sight and light; creatures can pass through it. Walls are made for it by the GM's client, and removed when the spell ends. It changes no item: midi applies it to any item with the identifier <code>wall-of-fire</code> (2024 rules) that nothing else automates.</p>",
